1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,260
In the year 845,

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:09,050
the Colossal Titan and the
Armored Titan suddenly appeared

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:13,640
and destroyed one of humanity's
walls-and everyday life with it.

4
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:19,020
Humanity abandoned Wall Maria,

5
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:22,780
lost 20% of its population
and one-third of its territory,

6
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:27,780
and was forced to
retreat behind Wall Rose.

7
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:33,790
Then, in the year 850, in Trost District...

8
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:38,710
Once again, humanity allowed the
Titans to further their advance.

9
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:42,920
And Eren Jaeger,
who had fallen prey to one,

10
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:47,930
reappeared from inside
a mysterious Titan...

11
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:09,160
Unknown are the names
of the flowers that have been trampled

12
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:14,620
Birds have fallen to the earth
and long for the wind

13
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:19,710
Prayers won't solve anything

14
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:25,050
Only the will to fight
can change the here and now!

15
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:30,340
O pigs who laugh at the resolve
to walk over corpses to move forward

16
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:32,890
Livestock complacency? False prosperity?

17
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:35,770
Give us the freedom of dying,
starving wolves!

18
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:41,150
The humiliation of being caged
is what triggers us to fight back

19
00:01:41,350 --> 00:01:46,440
We hunters slaughter prey
beyond the castle walls,

20
00:01:46,650 --> 00:01:51,660
consumed with surging bloodlust,

21
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:58,790
as our crimson bows and arrows
pierce scarlet holes into the twilight

22
00:02:20,995 --> 00:02:26,000
Response: The Struggle for Trost, Part 6

23
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,030
I'll ask one more time!

24
00:02:28,230 --> 00:02:30,900
What are you really?!

25
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:32,530
I'm human!

26
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,580
I see...

27
00:02:39,540 --> 00:02:42,250
Don't take this personally.

28
00:02:47,170 --> 00:02:48,000
Marco...

29
00:02:48,210 --> 00:02:50,300
I can't do this anymore...

30
00:02:50,510 --> 00:02:52,800
I can't fight Titans anymore!

31
00:02:53,010 --> 00:02:54,260
What's gotten into you?!

32
00:02:54,470 --> 00:02:56,300
My friends got
eaten right in front of me!

33
00:02:56,510 --> 00:03:01,480
My friends got killed, yet I didn't
feel any sadness or hate at all!

34
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:06,060
Deep down,
I just felt glad it wasn't me...!

35
00:03:06,270 --> 00:03:08,820
But it's my turn next.

36
00:03:09,020 --> 00:03:11,650
I've realized what our job is...

37
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:16,370
It's basically fighting and fighting
until we eventually get eaten!

38
00:03:16,570 --> 00:03:19,030
Well, screw that! I'd rather end things now...!

39
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:21,500
Stop! Pull yourself together!

40
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:23,120
You aren't the only one, you know!

41
00:03:23,330 --> 00:03:25,880
We're all fighting back fear!

42
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,210
Just look at Sasha!

43
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:31,840
Even after what she went through,
she's still an upstanding soldier!

44
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,680
Umm... My stomach hurts...

45
00:03:35,890 --> 00:03:38,350
Could you please consider
me one of the wounded?

46
00:03:40,060 --> 00:03:41,890
- I can't go on!
- Stop!

47
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,520
Stop it!

48
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:47,610
That gag order is
definitely warranted.

49
00:03:47,810 --> 00:03:50,440
The situation's bad enough as it is.

50
00:03:50,650 --> 00:03:52,940
If they found out about Eren...

51
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,330
Cannon fire?!

52
00:04:01,540 --> 00:04:02,870
Why only one shot?!

53
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,870
Look! Smoke!

54
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,460
It's inside the wall!

55
00:04:06,670 --> 00:04:09,630
- Hey!
- What's happening?!

56
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,000
What's going on?!

57
00:04:11,210 --> 00:04:13,300
Did they break through the water gate?!

58
00:04:13,510 --> 00:04:15,720
Impossible!
That's the sturdiest place of all!

59
00:04:15,930 --> 00:04:18,010
They must've just
set off a shell by accident!

60
00:04:18,220 --> 00:04:19,390
Still...

61
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,180
Why's there so much smoke?!

62
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:26,520
No way... Is it Titan steam?!

63
00:04:26,730 --> 00:04:28,150
Hey!

64
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:29,940
H-Hey!

65
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:55,630
What the hell...?!

66
00:05:16,610 --> 00:05:17,950
It's alive!

67
00:05:18,150 --> 00:05:19,740
Captain Woermann!

68
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:26,750
W-Wait and see what it does!
We can't risk getting near it!

69
00:05:26,950 --> 00:05:30,250
Stay on alert, everyone!
Remain on standby!

70
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:33,920
Artillerymen, reload the cannon!

71
00:06:05,660 --> 00:06:07,290
What is this...?

72
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:12,750
I-I remember hearing the cannon go off...

73
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:16,460
After that came a tremendous
sound, shock, and heat!

74
00:06:16,670 --> 00:06:19,260
And now we're inside a giant skeleton...

75
00:06:19,470 --> 00:06:21,880
Eren protected us.

76
00:06:22,090 --> 00:06:24,850
That's all we need to understand for now.

77
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:31,730
Flowers, only on the inside...?

78
00:06:31,940 --> 00:06:33,350
Hey!

79
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:36,320
You guys okay?!

80
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,280
Eren! What is this?!

81
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,440
I don't know!

82
00:06:39,650 --> 00:06:43,450
But it's already starting to vaporize,
just like a Titan's corpse!

83
00:06:43,660 --> 00:06:45,740
Let's get away from it!

84
00:06:46,530 --> 00:06:49,660
Can't tell if they're watching
and waiting or if they're in a daze...

85
00:06:49,870 --> 00:06:53,580
The Garrison Regiment isn't
showing any signs of activity for now...

86
00:06:54,790 --> 00:06:59,090
...but I'm sure they'll start
attacking again soon enough.

87
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:04,010
I doubt there's any chance of reasoning
with them now, after seeing this.

88
00:07:04,220 --> 00:07:07,390
But there is one
thing I remember now.

89
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,810
The basement.

90
00:07:09,010 --> 00:07:10,640
The basement of my house!

91
00:07:11,180 --> 00:07:14,850
My dad said it'd all
make sense if I go there!

92
00:07:15,060 --> 00:07:18,150
He's also the reason
this has happened to me...

93
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:24,610
If I go to the basement, I might
figure out what the Titans are too!

94
00:07:27,530 --> 00:07:29,030
Damn it!

95
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,330
Then why did he keep it a secret?!

96
00:07:31,540 --> 00:07:36,460
Thousands of Scouts have
died trying to get that information!

97
00:07:36,670 --> 00:07:39,710
It's the only hope humanity has!

98
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:44,630
And he just kept it tucked away
in our basement all this time?!

99
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:47,850
What the hell was he thinking?!

100
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:53,310
And where the hell has
he been these last five years...

101
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,100
Eren.

102
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:57,980
We have other things to attend to right now.

103
00:07:58,860 --> 00:08:00,270
Yeah...

104
00:08:01,070 --> 00:08:02,070
The smoke's clearing!

105
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,150
Attack on sight!

106
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,240
Let's finish it off quick!

107
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:06,280
Hold your positions!

108
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:21,170
I'm getting out of here.

109
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:24,590
- And going where? How?!
- Anywhere will do for now.

110
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:27,760
Then I'll go over the wall and
make for the basement.

111
00:08:27,970 --> 00:08:29,970
After I've changed into a Titan again.

112
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:32,430
Can you really do that?

113
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:35,680
I don't know how I'm doing it, either.

114
00:08:35,890 --> 00:08:38,150
But I know I can do it!

115
00:08:38,350 --> 00:08:43,070
It's just like how I can't really
explain how I'm moving my arm.

116
00:08:44,110 --> 00:08:48,160
Just now, my mind unconsciously
focused on stopping the cannonball.

117
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:52,740
That's why it decayed; it only had
the capabilities and endurance for that.

118
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,830
Next time I'm gonna
be an even stronger one...

119
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:02,840
I'm gonna be a 15 meter-high one
that can slaughter other Titans, like before!

120
00:09:03,050 --> 00:09:04,460
Eren!

121
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:06,800
Your nose is bleeding...

122
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:11,720
You look really pale,
and your breathing is rough.

123
00:09:11,930 --> 00:09:15,310
Somethings clearly wrong!
You're not well!

124
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:18,940
My health doesn't matter right now!

125
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:21,230
I have two ideas in mind.

126
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:26,570
You guys can get through this
alive if you stop trying to protect me.

127
00:09:27,530 --> 00:09:30,320
I've already caused
you enough trouble as it is,

128
00:09:30,530 --> 00:09:33,490
so I'm gonna go
it alone from here on out.

129
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,580
You can't be serious...

130
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:37,410
...Eren.

131
00:09:38,210 --> 00:09:39,000
I'm coming with you.

132
00:09:39,210 --> 00:09:40,370
No!

133
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:43,670
If I don't keep up,
you won't have to worry about me.

134
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:46,800
But I won't have to
do what you say, either.

135
00:09:47,010 --> 00:09:49,420
I'm serious here!
Just forget about it!

136
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:52,890
I'm not your little brother or your kid!

137
00:10:02,850 --> 00:10:05,020
What the hell?!

138
00:10:05,230 --> 00:10:09,070
Sir. The cannon is almost reloaded.

139
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:12,610
What are your next attack orders?

140
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,990
You will wait for my signal!

141
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,910
Yes, Sir!

142
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:21,080
For now, the Garrison Regiment
isn't showing any signs

143
00:10:21,290 --> 00:10:23,330
of launching a close-quarters assault.

144
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:28,630
If they were, Mikasa would've
sensed it faster than a stray cat.

145
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:31,800
Assuming they reload in
the shortest time possible...

146
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:34,470
...it'll take them about twenty more seconds.

147
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:39,430
I figure Eren will spring into
action and be gone before then...

148
00:10:43,060 --> 00:10:47,860
Why am I reminded
of that at a time like this?

149
00:10:48,070 --> 00:10:52,360
Is it... because
this is the end for us?

150
00:10:53,490 --> 00:10:56,280
In the very end,

151
00:10:56,490 --> 00:11:01,080
I never amounted to
anything more than a coward...

152
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:05,540
They were there to
help me so many times...

153
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:10,840
...but not once did
l ever manage to help them.

154
00:11:14,260 --> 00:11:18,720
How can I possibly
call myself an equal friend?

155
00:11:18,930 --> 00:11:23,100
How can I possibly
offer to go with them?

156
00:11:23,310 --> 00:11:27,150
I'm not even confident
I can keep up...

157
00:11:36,410 --> 00:11:39,330
I guess this is the last time...

158
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:45,790
...the three of us will ever be together...

159
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:47,830
Eren. I am...

160
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,880
Wait, Mikasa!

161
00:11:50,090 --> 00:11:53,380
I said I had two ideas, remember?

162
00:11:53,590 --> 00:11:57,590
Armin. I leave the decision to you.

163
00:11:58,430 --> 00:11:59,220
Huh?

164
00:11:59,430 --> 00:12:03,980
Even I know how unrealistic this plan is.

165
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:06,980
The best option would
be to use this Titan ability

166
00:12:07,190 --> 00:12:11,110
in a systematic way,
under the military's direction.

167
00:12:12,230 --> 00:12:14,400
I know this sounds crazy,

168
00:12:14,610 --> 00:12:21,370
but if you think you can convince the
Garrison Regiment that I'm not a threat,

169
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:24,450
I'll trust in you and go with that option.

170
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:27,370
That's my second idea.

171
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:31,880
If you don't think you can do it,
I'll go with the other idea as a last resort.

172
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:36,380
Decide in fifteen seconds.

173
00:12:36,590 --> 00:12:38,390
Can you do it or not?

174
00:12:38,590 --> 00:12:41,390
I'll respect your opinion,
whichever it is.

175
00:12:46,180 --> 00:12:47,770
Eren...

176
00:12:47,980 --> 00:12:51,570
Why are you entrusting such an
important decision to me?

177
00:12:51,770 --> 00:12:57,200
Even when things get ugly,
you always make the right call, y'know?

178
00:12:57,400 --> 00:13:00,530
I figure that's worth relying on.

179
00:13:00,740 --> 00:13:02,410
When did I ever do that...?

180
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:06,160
All the time.
Like that time five years ago...

181
00:13:06,370 --> 00:13:09,420
If you hadn't gone and
gotten Mr. Hannes for us,

182
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:12,840
Mikasa and I would've been Titan food.

183
00:13:21,050 --> 00:13:26,020
It was all in my head... I convinced
myself that's how I was...

184
00:13:27,230 --> 00:13:32,560
I convinced myself
I was helpless and a burden...

185
00:13:35,230 --> 00:13:38,900
But they never felt that way at all...!

186
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:41,820
Armin! We're out of time!

187
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,200
They've finished reloading, Sir!

188
00:13:46,410 --> 00:13:48,250
We can fire at any time!

189
00:13:48,460 --> 00:13:51,920
These two who are willing
to place their lives in my hands...

190
00:13:52,130 --> 00:13:57,300
...are the people I trust
more than anyone in this world.

191
00:13:57,510 --> 00:14:02,050
What more convincing
do I need than that?!

192
00:14:05,140 --> 00:14:07,350
I will persuade them, without fail.

193
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:11,810
I'll need you to act as
nonaggressive as possible.

194
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:22,990
Something's been bugging me ever
since Eren started fighting as a Titan.

195
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,780
I haven't collected my
thoughts yet, but I'll do this!

196
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:28,870
I'll have to think as I talk!

197
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:34,330
Halt!

198
00:14:39,010 --> 00:14:41,680
You've finally revealed your true form, monster!

199
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:45,010
I'll do it! I'll give the signal to fire!

200
00:14:45,220 --> 00:14:47,510
He is not an enemy of humanity!

201
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:52,020
We're willing to disclose
everything we've learned!

202
00:14:52,230 --> 00:14:54,270
Begging for your lives won't help you!

203
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:58,150
He's revealed his true form for
all to see! What more is there to say?!

204
00:14:58,360 --> 00:15:01,070
If you insist he's not our enemy,
then show me proof!

205
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:04,570
If you can't, then we'll simply
eliminate the threat he poses!

206
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:07,080
There's no need for proof!

207
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:10,000
That's right... There is no need!

208
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:14,420
In fact, this isn't about
what we perceive him to be!

209
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:15,580
What?!

210
00:15:15,790 --> 00:15:18,590
I hear that countless people saw him!

211
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:21,880
In which case, they surely
saw him fighting Titans as well!

212
00:15:22,090 --> 00:15:26,010
And they must've seen the
Titans swarming around him too!

213
00:15:26,970 --> 00:15:32,810
In other words, the Titans saw
him as prey-just like they see us!

214
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:38,190
That's an irrefutable fact,
however hard you look at it!

215
00:15:41,990 --> 00:15:43,570
He has a point...

216
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:46,990
- A Titan, on our side?
- That's crazy...!

217
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:57,380
Prepare to attack!

218
00:15:57,580 --> 00:16:01,090
Don't be taken in
by their clever ruses!

219
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:05,720
Their behavior has always
been beyond our understanding!

220
00:16:05,930 --> 00:16:10,510
It's entirely possible they'd take on
human form and use human language

221
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,520
to deceive us all!

222
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:16,060
We can't let them have their way anymore!

223
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:21,270
It's no use...

224
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:24,740
He's abandoned all logic...

225
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:27,820
He's afraid to think...

226
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:31,120
Eren! Mikasa!

227
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:43,460
As a soldier, I have
long sworn to give my heart

228
00:16:43,670 --> 00:16:46,420
for the restoration of humankind!

229
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:51,010
Nothing would make me
happier than to die for that cause!

230
00:16:51,220 --> 00:16:55,730
If we combine his Titan ability
with our own remaining manpower,

231
00:16:55,930 --> 00:16:59,060
we can retake this city!

232
00:16:59,270 --> 00:17:01,270
For humanity's glory,

233
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:04,150
in what little time I have left to live,

234
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:07,820
I will continue to
advocate his strategic value!

235
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:13,410
Captain Woermann.

236
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:15,160
I believe his words are worth consid-

237
00:17:15,370 --> 00:17:16,870
Silence!

238
00:17:18,370 --> 00:17:21,840
However much they beg
for their lives, they're still traitors...

239
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:24,210
To dispose of those who violate the rules...

240
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:27,590
That is the duty of a soldier!

241
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:32,890
That's enough.

242
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:39,140
I see you're still as delicate
as a young deer despite your size.

243
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,230
Commander Pyxis...!

244
00:17:44,230 --> 00:17:47,280
Can you not see that
soldier's splendid salute?

245
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:54,910
I've only just arrived, but I've
been filled in on the situation.

246
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:57,540
You're in charge of
the reinforcements now.

247
00:17:57,750 --> 00:18:02,790
Something tells me we ought
to hear these people out, you see...

248
00:18:09,170 --> 00:18:11,760
According to the
Scout Regiment's reports,

249
00:18:11,970 --> 00:18:15,220
it was believed that the
Titans would appear from the south.

250
00:18:15,430 --> 00:18:19,850
Indeed, it was Shiganshina District,
on the south side of Wall Maria,

251
00:18:20,060 --> 00:18:22,850
that the Titans attacked.

252
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:28,360
As a result, the fortified city of Trost
on the south side of Wall Rose

253
00:18:28,570 --> 00:18:33,070
was deemed their next most likely target.

254
00:18:37,700 --> 00:18:39,750
Dot Pyxis...

255
00:18:39,950 --> 00:18:45,500
The top officer in charge of Trost
and the entire southern territory,

256
00:18:45,710 --> 00:18:50,130
and the man given full authority for the
defense of humanity's most vital region.

257
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:55,260
Nope, none at all...

258
00:18:55,470 --> 00:18:59,430
I certainly wouldn't mind being
gobbled up by a beautiful girl Titan...

259
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:05,020
And he's also known for
being a full-blown eccentric.

260
00:19:05,230 --> 00:19:07,770
What is the commander thinking?!

261
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:11,610
Taking those freaks up
there without a single bodyguard...!

262
00:19:11,820 --> 00:19:17,240
I don't know. He's never
been one to make much sense.

263
00:19:17,450 --> 00:19:18,870
Sir.

264
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:21,540
We've finished reassembling the troops.

265
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:22,710
Right.

266
00:19:22,910 --> 00:19:24,420
Good work.

267
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:30,670
I see.

268
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:33,380
And visiting this basement will
make everything clear?

269
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:36,680
Yes... Do you believe me?

270
00:19:36,890 --> 00:19:39,260
Seeing as you, yourself,
are unable to provide validation,

271
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:43,560
for now I'm simply
keeping it all in mind.

272
00:19:43,770 --> 00:19:49,070
But I do believe I can tell when
someone is being sincere or not.

273
00:19:49,270 --> 00:19:53,110
I will personally guarantee your safety.

274
00:19:55,030 --> 00:19:57,820
Cadet Arlelt, was it?

275
00:19:58,030 --> 00:19:59,080
Yes, Sir!

276
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:02,660
Earlier, you mentioned that
with this so-called "Titan ability"

277
00:20:02,870 --> 00:20:06,170
it would be possible to retake this city.

278
00:20:06,370 --> 00:20:08,210
Do you truly believe that?

279
00:20:08,420 --> 00:20:12,300
Or was that just a
desperate plea for your life?

280
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:13,920
Well...

281
00:20:14,970 --> 00:20:16,930
Both.

282
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:22,970
I was going to suggest that Eren,
in Titan form, could take that giant rock

283
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:26,850
and use it to block the wrecked entrance.

284
00:20:27,060 --> 00:20:30,610
It was just an idea
I came up with on the spot...

285
00:20:30,820 --> 00:20:33,860
I just wanted them to see
the possibilities of Eren's ability

286
00:20:34,070 --> 00:20:37,780
and how it could help
solve the situation we're in...

287
00:20:40,580 --> 00:20:43,790
Of course, I was
desperate to survive, too!

288
00:20:45,410 --> 00:20:47,540
"Desperate to survive..."

289
00:20:47,750 --> 00:20:50,960
There's nothing more
credible than those words.

290
00:20:59,220 --> 00:21:02,350
What do you say, Cadet Jaeger?

291
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:03,930
Sir?

292
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:06,850
Can you plug the hole?

293
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:11,900
Well... Uhh...

294
00:21:12,110 --> 00:21:13,440
I'm not sure.

295
00:21:13,650 --> 00:21:19,200
Right now, I don't really understand
any more than the rest of you.

296
00:21:19,410 --> 00:21:22,160
Maybe I can. Maybe I can't. I don't know.

297
00:21:22,370 --> 00:21:25,450
I don't feel I can risk
giving an irresponsible answer...

298
00:21:25,660 --> 00:21:28,330
Ah, yes. My apologies.

299
00:21:28,540 --> 00:21:31,210
I asked the wrong question.

300
00:21:32,750 --> 00:21:36,670
Will you do it or not?

301
00:22:05,660 --> 00:22:07,290
I'll do it.

302
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:09,750
I'll do it!

303
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:12,630
I don't know if
I can plug the hole or not.

304
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:14,090
But...

305
00:22:14,290 --> 00:22:15,920
I'll do it!

306
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:41,320
Your dreams are where your heart is

307
00:22:41,530 --> 00:22:47,580
They're more fragile than life itself

308
00:22:47,790 --> 00:22:52,250
Over and over you cast them aside,
only to find more

309
00:22:52,460 --> 00:22:58,920
Now, rest in peace

310
00:22:59,130 --> 00:23:10,270
Pounding impulses defile the things we wish for

311
00:23:10,480 --> 00:23:20,530
and the more we forget
the more we remember again

312
00:23:20,740 --> 00:23:26,490
In this beautiful, cruel world

313
00:23:26,700 --> 00:23:31,660
all I can do is ask why we're still alive

314
00:23:31,870 --> 00:23:37,380
Oh, with our strength... and our weakness...

315
00:23:37,590 --> 00:23:43,050
what are we going to protect if there's no sense

316
00:23:43,260 --> 00:23:46,680
to anything anymore?

317
00:23:54,270 --> 00:23:56,690
Despite having fled
out of fear once before,

318
00:23:56,900 --> 00:24:01,070
the soldiers choose to
stand on the battlefield again.

319
00:24:01,280 --> 00:24:03,570
Eren makes up his mind:

320
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:05,632
"I'll be everyone's hope."

321
00:24:05,632 --> 00:24:06,490
Idol: The Struggle for Trost, Part 7
"I'll be everyone's hope."

322
00:24:06,490 --> 00:24:07,008
Idol: The Struggle for Trost, Part 7
